aphic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An antigelling agent for a hydrocarbon mixture containing a conjugated diene, which comprises (a) at least one compound selected from the group consisting of compounds having an NO radical in the molecule and precursors capable of forming an NO radical; (b) a phosphorus compound, and (c) at least one compound selected from the group consisting of heterocyclic aldehydes, aromatic aldehydes, and condensates of these.  By adding the antigelling agent to an apparatus for separating and purifying a hydrocarbon mixture containing a conjugated diene, the apparatus is prevented from being clogged.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un agent antigélifiant pour un mélange d'hydrocarbures contenant un diène conjugué. Ledit agent comprend (a) au moins un composé choisi dans le groupe constitué de composés possédant un radical NO dans leur molécule et des précurseurs capables de former un radical NO ; (b) un composé phosphoré, et (c) au moins un composé choisi dans le groupe constitué d'aldéhydes hétérocycliques, d'aldéhydes aromatiques et de condensats de ceux-ci. En ajoutant ledit agent antigélifiant dans l'appareil de séparation et de purification du mélange d'hydrocarbures contenant un diène conjugué, on empêche l'appareil de s'encrasser.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>